OL,3,GNEWSAParole denied for seventh time
OL,4,Aover 1995 murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FA convicted killer who murdered a woman
OL,7,Fwhose body has never been found has had
OL,8,Fhis latest bid for parole rejected.
OL,10,FPeter Turner was sentenced to life in
OL,11,Fprison in 1996 after he was found
OL,12,Fguilty of murdering 26-year-old Teresa
OL,13,FShephard, from Sheffield, who went
OL,14,Fmissing in June 1995.
OL,16,FLast month, police excavated an area of
OL,17,Fland off Piper Lane in Aston,
OL,18,FRotherham, in search of Teresa's body,
OL,19,Fbut later confirmed nothing had been
OL,20,Ffound.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
