OL,3,GNEWSAParole denied for seventh time
OL,4,Aover 1995 murder
OL,5,
OL,6,FRuling on Turner's seventh bid for
OL,7,Frelease, the Parole Board said it was
OL,8,F"not satisfied that release at this
OL,9,Fpoint would be safe for the protection
OL,10,Fof the public".
